></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span>6232813760001715597</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p><span>银行行号： </span><span><br/>\n</span><span>请登录重庆市公共资源交易网（www.cqggzy.com）对应栏目查看。 </span><span><br/>\n</span><span>路径：服务导航-政府采购-办事指引-重庆市公共资源交易中心政府采购项目保证金银行联行行号。 </span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span>1.2各</span><span>供应商</span><span>在银行转账（电汇）时，须充分考虑银行转账（电汇）的时间差风险，如同城转账、异地转账或汇款、跨行转账或电汇的时间要求。</span></p>\n<p><span>1.3保证金退还方式</span></p>\n<p><span>1.3.1未</span><span>成交供应商</span><span>的保证金，在</span><span>成交</span><span>通知书发放后，重庆市公共资源交易中心在五个工作日内按来款渠道直接退还。</span></p>\n<p><b><span>1.3.2</span></b><b><span>成交供应商</span></b><b><span>的投标保证金，在</span></b><b><span>成交供应商</span></b><b><span>与</span></b><b><span>招标人</span></b><b><span>签订合同后，重庆市公共资源交易中心在五个工作日内按资金来款渠道直接退还。</span></b></p>\n<p><span>重庆市公共资源交易中心咨询电话：023-63625633</span></p>\n<p><!--[i--></p></div>", "html": "", "method": "采购公告", "region": "重庆", "buyer": "2026年度省市级社", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.cqggzy.com/uploadFiles/%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "name": "%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "ext": "pdf", "local_file": "93837__E9_87_8D_E5_BA_86_E5_B8_82_E5_85_AC_E5_85_B1_E8_B5_84_E6_BA_90_E4_BA_A4_E6_98_93_E7_BD_91_E6_96_B0_"}, {"url": "https://fgw.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/cjzxjyzx/", "name": "attachment", "ext": "download", "local_file": "93837__E9_87_8D_E5_BA_86_E5_B8_82_E5_85_AC_E5_85_B1_E8_B5_84_E6_BA_90_E4_BA_A4_E6_98_93_E7_BD_91_E6_96_B0_"}, {"url": "https://ggzydl.cqggzy.com/CQTPBidder/jsgcztbmis2/pages/zbfilelingqu_hy/cQZBFileDownAttachAction.action?cmd=download&AttachGuid=b53690b6-0611-4254-8c6f-2627d7e12abf&code=J070&tradeGuid=f6c40d81-2378-42dd-8aef-0ffebcd46ef4", "name": "b53690b6",